@startuml
title Create Group — sequence
actor User
participant "Web UI / Mobile" as UI
participant "Groups Service" as Groups
participant "Auth Service" as Auth
database DB

User -> UI: Open 'Create group' form
UI -> Auth: validate session / token
Auth --> UI: 200 OK
UI -> Groups: POST /api/v1/groups {payload}
Groups -> DB: INSERT group + owner
DB --> Groups: group_id
Groups -> Groups: generate join_code
Groups --> UI: 201 Created {group_id, join_code}
UI --> User: show confirmation + shareable URL/QR
@enduml